 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "EscapeRoom(n, m) creates rooms 0..n-1 and players 0..m-1, all in room 0. advance(player) moves the player to the next room; a player already in room n - 1 stays there (the call is ignored). countInRoom(room) returns how many players are in that room. topPlayers(k) returns up to k player ids ranked by current room (higher first), then by the time they entered that room (earlier first); players who have never moved rank by id. It returns min(k, m) ids. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk15-b-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
